  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STREAM Mongolia: SusTainable Resilient Ecosystem and Agriculture Management in Mongolia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Action is geared towards integrated land-use planning and protection of natural resources by means of sustainable management, both to be applied at a landscape scale. Its overall objective is that Mongolian communities have increased capacity to implement innovative and sustainable long-term landscape management to address food system challenges and climate stresses.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
